        "answer": {
          "short": "$t=11$, $V=7000$",
          "worked": "Substitute $V=40000-3000t$ into $V=62000-5000t$.\n$$\\begin{align*}40000-3000t&=62000-5000t\\\\2000t&=22000\\\\t&=11\\end{align*}$$\nSubstitute $t=11$ into the sports coupe rule.\n$$\\begin{align*}V&=62000-5000(11)\\\\V&=7000\\end{align*}$$\nThus the cars have the same value of $\\$7000$ after 11 years.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 48
